  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance d&#x2019;urgence pour les personnes d&#xE9;plac&#xE9;es dans la province du Lac</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide shelter and food security assistance to internally displaced persons in the Lac district. This IOM project supports the biometric registration of newly displaced families and distributes shelter kits. The food security component of the project provides humanitarian assistance to 143,600 people, including 35,500 women, 29,000 men, 79,100 children, and including 21,500 persons with disabilities. The shelter component provides humanitarian assistance to 6,800 people.</narrative>
  </description>
